{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite <strong>1-6\u00a0</strong>player Co-op top-down dungeon crawler. <strong>Slay</strong> mobs, <strong>loot</strong> chests, <strong>explore</strong> the map, <strong>craft</strong> wands and <strong>upgrade</strong> spells in a team attempt to escape from the magical dimension by conquering all <strong>4 seasons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends or strangers in  <strong>online Co-op</strong>. A coven can have up to 6 players - public and private lobbies are supported. The game can also be played singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/d640b24eec801134e32bf26a888bc1b8.poster.avif?t=1757513402\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/d640b24eec801134e32bf26a888bc1b8.webm?t=1757513402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your loot</strong> - chests have 3 options to choose and all players can open each chest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your spell builds</strong> - there are 9 spells and each one has many unique upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft powerful wands</strong> - fuse magical objects you find along the way!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/93c0392ae66a49d98309013c90f87906.poster.avif?t=1757513402\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/93c0392ae66a49d98309013c90f87906.webm?t=1757513402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goals is to escape the magical dimension by slaying <strong>4 unique bosses</strong>, one for each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy</strong> is key - is your coven skilled enough to win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/88c27fc2271e3e7f5ad15fa42297b454.poster.avif?t=1757513402\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/88c27fc2271e3e7f5ad15fa42297b454.webm?t=1757513402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548370?t=1757513402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548370?t=1757513402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/d672babccb12b4113f1d4d10ef5e40a21e5b5c79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757513402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/d672babccb12b4113f1d4d10ef5e40a21e5b5c79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757513402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite <strong>1-6\u00a0</strong>player Co-op top-down d